    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jennaani Yoshuani worra gosa Reubenitifi ta Gaditifi ta Manase ta ilaboru wolti yaame. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.32.20+NUM.32.21+NUM.32.22+NUM.32.23+NUM.32.24+NUM.32.25+NUM.32.26+NUM.32.27+NUM.32.28+NUM.32.29+NUM.32.30+NUM.32.31+NUM.32.32"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Hen 32.20-32",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.1.12+JOS.1.13+JOS.1.14+JOS.1.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yos 1.12-15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waan jed'eeni, isani waan hojattuuni AABBO Waaqa Musani tolcha jed'e ya tolchitani, ammalle dubbi tiyya ch'ufale ya guutani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haga arra isani oboleyaani teesani ta Israeli biraa indeemne, ammalle isani dubbi AABBO Waaqa keesani ya aka dansa guutani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammo akuma inni iti kakhate, AABBO Waaqi keesani yayu oboleyaani teesani ta Israeli nagaya kenneefi. Tanaafi beena lafa isani teenna jettani, ta galaana Yordani ilaboru jirtu ta hojattuuni AABBO Waaqa Musani isanii kenneti gala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Seera hojattuuni AABBO Waaqa Musani isanii kenne jabeesa guuta: AABBO Waaqa keesani jaalad'a, fed'i isaa tolcha, seera isaa guuta iraa ingorina, garaafi qalbi teesani ch'ufaani isaa hojad'a. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoshuani eebaafi dubbi taanaani worra galche waan jed'eeni, waan horattani kanani worra keesaniti gala: loonifi qarsiifi worqifi sibiila diimafi guraachafi woya heddu argattani. Waan nyaapa keesani iraa boojitani oboleyaani teesaniini gaha. Inni jecha kana buufannaani worri kae gale. Musani yayu gosa Manase ta gariti lafa Yordani ilaboru kenne, ammo gosa Manase taani d'ibi Yoshuani yayu lafa galaana Yordaniti ila adu gosa d'ibi woliini kenneefi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.6+JOS.22.7+JOS.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.6",
              "JOS.22.7",
              "JOS.22.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akanaani worri gosa Reubenitifi Gaditifi ka Manase ka ila boru kae gale. Worri gumi Israeli taani Shilo lafa Kanaani keesati biraa yae, lafa isaani ta Gileadi ta, akuma AABBO Waaqi Musani jed'e worri argateti dachae.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Fulla sorio irati qalani ta Yordani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worri gosa Reubenitifi ka Gaditifi ka Manase ka ilaboru Gelilothi, ka Yordanini ila adu jiru gahe, arti d'aatu galaanati fulla ballo toko ta sorio irati Waaqaa baasani jaarani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duuba qonqoni gara d'ibii worra Israeliti d'ufte waan jette, Me d'agaya! Worri Reubenitifi ka Gaditifi ka Manase ka ilaboru yayu Gelilothi Yordani gama kaaniti fulla Waaqaa sorio iti baasani jaare. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worri Israeli waan kana d'ageennaani, gumiini ch'ufti Shiloti wolti baate, aka worra suni haatu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jennaani worri Israeli Finehasi, ilma qaallicha Eleazari, gara worra gosa Reubenitifi ka Gaditifi ka Manase ka ilaboru, lafa Gileadi keesa erge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jaaroleeni gugurdooni, nami kud'ani, gosa ila adu keesaa toko tokooni, ammalle ta isiini ch'ufti namu balbalafi worraleti mataa, Finehasi woliini yaani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lafa Gileadi, fulla worri Reubenitifi ka Gaditifi ka Manase ka ilaboru jiruni d'ufani waan jed'aniini, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.12.13+DEU.12.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Qab-Ser 12.13-14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " gumiini AABBO Waaqa waan jettu, isani maafi waan hamtu kana Waaqa Israeliti tolchitani? Waan isani fulla sorio Waaqaa baasani jaartanifi ya AABBO Waaqa diddani, isani ya gargaltani AABBO Waaqa gula yau diddani! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.25.1+NUM.25.2+NUM.25.3+NUM.25.4+NUM.25.5+NUM.25.6+NUM.25.7+NUM.25.8+NUM.25.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Hen 25.1-9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daba keenna ka nu lafa Peoriti tolchine, gaafa AABBO Waaqi d'ukubaani nu balleese inqaabatani? Nu ammalle ufiftu waan sunifi gaargalu jira, dabi sunini nuu ingeenne? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammalle isa gula yau diddani? Yo isani arra AABBO Waaqa diddani, inni borifa worra Israeli ch'ufati dallana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amma duuba yo lafti teesani qulqullo intahini lafa Kanaaniti fulla Waaroni isaa ejituti taaka, nuti koota, gama keennati lafa fud'ad'a. Ammo AABBO Waaqa indidina, yokhaani fulla sorio Waaqa iti baasani teenna tana male ta d'ibi jaaratani, nama Waaqa didu nu intolchina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.7.1+JOS.7.2+JOS.7.3+JOS.7.4+JOS.7.5+JOS.7.6+JOS.7.7+JOS.7.8+JOS.7.9+JOS.7.10+JOS.7.11+JOS.7.12+JOS.7.13+JOS.7.14+JOS.7.15+JOS.7.16+JOS.7.17+JOS.7.18+JOS.7.19+JOS.7.20+JOS.7.21+JOS.7.22+JOS.7.23+JOS.7.24+JOS.7.25+JOS.7.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yos 7.1-26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Aka Akaniini ilmi Zera seera waan balleesu malani ch'abse ammalle gumi Israeli ch'ufa waan suni jed'ani gaargalchani inqaabatani? Nami gaafasi maro daba isaatiifi due isa ch'allaniti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worri Reubenitifi ka Gaditifi ka Manase ka ilaboru waan jaarole mataa worraa ta gosa ila adutini jed'e, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jabaani Waaqa! Inni AABBO! Inni waan nu akana taanefi imbeekha nuleeni aka isani beetani feena! Yo nu AABBO Waaqa d'ugefachu lakimne isa gula yau dinne, arruma nu hobaasa! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yo nu AABBO Waaqa dinne, fulla sorio gubani yokhaani ta mid'aanifi ta wold'ageeti ta Waaqa baasani jaarre, ha innumani nu balleesuti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiyo akananiti! Wonti nu akasi tolchineefi aka taka tana ilmaani teesani, isani AABBO Waaqa Israeli maani iraa qabdani ilmaani teennaani injenne. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inni galaana Yordani seera jiddu teennafi isani worra Reubenitifi worra Gadi tolche. Ammalle isani AABBO Waaqa qooda womatu iraa inqabdani. Akasiini hegeri ilmaani teesani ilmaani teenna AABBO Waaqa kad'achu d'owarti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tanaafi nu fulla sorio Waaqaa baasani jaarre, aka sorio gubani yokhaani Waaqa wo baasaniniti, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ammo aka fullaani suni akheekha worra keennafi keesanifi yokhaani d'aloota taka tanale taatu, aka nu d'uguma AABBO Waaqa durati sorio teenna gumne waan Waaqa baasu malani ta wold'ageetile baamnu. Woni nu akasi taanefi aka taka tana ilmaani teesani, ilmaani teennaani isani, qooda womatu AABBO Waaqa iraa inqabdani injenne. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waan nu herenne, yo taka tana woni kunini taate, ilmaani teenna sila dubbi akana tanafa jetti: Me ilaala! Abbootini teenna fulla sorio Waaqa baasani ta aka teesani ijaarte. Fullaani sunini aka sorio gubani yokhaani waan Waaqa baasaniniti, ammo aka akheekha worra keennafi keesanile taatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AABBO Waaqi nu ijeesinna, yo nu isa dinne, yokhaani isa lakimne, fulla sorio gubanifi yokhaani ta mid'aanitifi yokhaani waan d'ibi Waaqa baasani ijaare. Nu fulla d'ibi sorio AABBO Waaqa irati baasani iniijaarru, ta Waaro Woyyuma dura ejitu male.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
